s-center gap-1.5\">\n          ♨️ 温泉・お風呂\n        </h4>\n        <span class=\"text-2xs font-extrabold text-amber-700 bg-amber-50 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md border border-amber-200\">お風呂 ★ 4.44 / 5.0</span>\n      </div>\n      <ul class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 space-y-1.5 leading-relaxed font-medium\">\n        <li><strong>設備:</strong> 温泉・大浴場・露天風呂・サウナ・家族風呂</li>\n        <li><strong>泉質:</strong> 硫酸塩泉・中性低張性冷鉱泉</li>\n        <li><strong>効能:</strong> 胃腸病・神経痛・婦人病</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- お食事・グルメ -->\n    <div class=\"p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-stone-200 shadow-xs space-y-2\">\n      <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-stone-100 pb-2\">\n        <h4 class=\"font-bold text-sm text-stone-900 flex items-center gap-1.5\">\n          🍽️ お食事スタイル・こだわり\n        </h4>\n        <span class=\"text-2xs font-extrabold text-orange-700 bg-orange-50 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md border border-orange-200\">夕食★4.3 / 朝食★4.35</span>\n      </div>\n      <ul class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 space-y-1.5 leading-relaxed font-medium\">\n        <li><strong>朝食:</strong> 部屋 / 個室</li>\n        <li><strong>夕食:</strong> 部屋 / 個室</li>\n        <li><strong>宿の特長:</strong> 創業440年。石段街最上段「黄金の湯」「白銀の湯」二湯を有す数少ない宿。</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- 駐車場・アクセス -->\n    <div class=\"p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-stone-200 shadow-xs space-y-2\">\n      <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-stone-100 pb-2\">\n        <h4 class=\"font-bold text-sm text-stone-900 flex items-center gap-1.5\">\n          🚗 駐車場・交通アクセス\n        </h4>\n        <span class=\"text-2xs font-extrabold text-emerald-700 bg-emerald-50 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md border border-emerald-200\">立地 ★4.39</span>\n      </div>\n      <ul class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 space-y-1.5 leading-relaxed font-medium\">\n        <li><strong>駐車場:</strong> 建物地下駐車場約50台 ※満車の場合は近隣駐車場を使う場合がございます</li>\n        <li><strong>アクセス:</strong> 渋川駅より伊香保温泉行きバス30分、終点伊香保温泉下車。新宿駅新南口発着の高速バス有※バス停から徒歩数分バス停